    "title": "'Wheel Of Fortune' Ryan Seacrest Comforts Devastated Contestant - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jennifer Havener ,\n11 hours ago\nRyan Seacrest has made a career out of connecting with people. He turned a stint hosting American Idol into a media monopoly that now includes a radio show. He was chosen to replace Pat Sajak on Wheel of Fortune. On one recent episode, Ryan comforted a devastated contestant after a stunning loss. Keep reading for all the details.\nRead full article\nAdd to Preferred Sources\n37",
